WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.569
-Greetings, lords and ladies.

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.504
I'm here with the one and only
Post Malone.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.707
And today we're gonna kick it
old-school, really old-school.

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:09.576
We're at Medieval Times.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:11.844
It's fantastic.
You look incredible.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:14.114
At this point, actually,
in Medieval times,

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.515
you're actually Pre Malone.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.483
-Hmm. Yet To Be Malone.
-Yeah, Yet --

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.987
You have not Malone'd yet.
I am so pumped for this.

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:22.522
Let's do it!

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:29.128
♪♪

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:30.963
[ Horse whinnies ]

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:36.135
♪♪

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:37.770
We are at Medieval Times.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.806
-This is the best day
of my life.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.574
♪♪

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.377
-All right, my lords.
We have your feast.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.845
-Thank you very much.
-Oh, my God.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.379
Thank you so much.
-Roasted chicken.

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:49.215
Roasted potato.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.885
-I like --
I like mashed potatoes better.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.421
-Mashed potatoes?
-Yeah.

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:57.256
Thank you so much.
Thank you so much.

00:00:57.256 --> 00:01:02.228
♪♪

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.231
-My lords, I am most pleased
to welcome you to my castle.

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.700
-My queen.
-My lord Post, might I add,

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.636
I am a big fan of your work.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:11.137
I really love your song
"Sunflower."

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:12.238
-Thank you. Oh, thank you.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.839
-Are you a fan of
"The Tonight Show"?

00:01:13.839 --> 00:01:16.775
-We don't have television
in Medieval times, my lord.

00:01:16.775 --> 00:01:18.578
-But you have Spotify?

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.713
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:23.850
♪♪

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.120
-Ride forth, Yellow Knight!

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.889
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:31.223
-Hey, baby.
-That's our dude.

00:01:31.223 --> 00:01:33.359
-Come on, baby.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.728
-There's Jonathan Van Ness
from "Queer Eye."

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.697
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.697 --> 00:01:41.201
Wow.

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:44.770
-Ride forth, the Red Knight!

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.306
-Boo! Sir.

00:01:47.306 --> 00:01:48.674
-Boo, sir!

00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:51.377
-I've seen squires
ride better than you!

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.913
-Ohh! Medieval burn!

00:01:53.913 --> 00:02:00.486
♪♪

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:02.455
-Ohh!
-Ohh!

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:03.957
-Yeah!

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:06.459
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.061
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:10.530
♪ You probably think that you
see yellow now, yellow now ♪

00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:13.866
♪ You probably think that you
see yellow now, yellow now ♪

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:15.668
-I think we need
to get out there.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:17.737
-Let's do this, man.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:20.673
♪♪

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:25.845
-Lords and ladies,
Jimmy Fallon and Post Malone!

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:30.883
♪♪

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:35.955
♪♪

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:38.458
-I couldn't even see
where this is.

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.560
-This helmet's heavy as [bleep].

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.361
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:47.033
-Knights, take up your weapons
and fulfill your oath!

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.668
-Oath!

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:51.370
It's hard to move.
My ass is sweating.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.106
-Sweat.

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:55.441
[ Grunting ]

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:58.578
[ Crowd chanting ]

00:02:58.578 --> 00:03:01.681
-Post, I challenge thee
to a joust!

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:04.416
-You lily-livered rapscallion!

00:03:04.416 --> 00:03:08.220
-Challenge has been issued
and accepted!

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.056
-♪ You know you make me
want to joust ♪

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:11.524
♪ Take my hands up and joust ♪

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:12.792
♪ Come on, now ♪
-♪ Joust ♪

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:14.561
-♪ Don't forget to say
you will, joust ♪

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:15.795
♪ Come on, now ♪
-♪ Joust ♪

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:17.430
-♪ Don't forget to say
you will, joust ♪

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.098
-Take your places, my lords.

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:22.468
And may your lance
find its mark.

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.670
Now ride!

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:26.906
♪♪

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:29.208
-Oh, wow.
-Ohh.

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:32.411
-[ Groaning ]

00:03:32.411 --> 00:03:33.679
-Oh. Ah. That one hurt.

00:03:33.679 --> 00:03:36.049
-My leg!
-Oh, no. Oh, no.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:38.251
Ow, ow, ow.

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:40.319
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.319 --> 00:03:42.622
[ Groaning ]

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:45.557
♪♪

00:03:45.557 --> 00:03:47.960
I have one more
surprise for you.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.996
Your Majesty.

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:52.297
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:52.297 --> 00:03:54.299
-I hereby dub thee...

00:03:54.299 --> 00:03:58.304
Lord Post Malone
of Medieval Times.

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:00.706
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:00.706 --> 00:04:03.542
-Yeah!
-Well done, my lord.

00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:05.845
-I just hugged the queen!
-I know you did!

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:09.115
-Yeah! Yeah!

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:10.917
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:13.886
-Medieval Times!

